1
00:00:04,541 --> 00:00:05,791
Stand down!

2
00:00:07,333 --> 00:00:09,000
Lower your weapons!

3
00:00:10,541 --> 00:00:12,791
It's him.

4
00:00:12,791 --> 00:00:14,458
He's  the Godfather.

5
00:00:14,916 --> 00:00:17,666
Only he possesses power like that!

6
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:21,500
No. No, no, no.

7
00:00:48,791 --> 00:00:52,583
My lord… thank you
for sparing my life.

8
00:00:56,916 --> 00:00:58,166
Lord Severin!

9
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,208
Wait!

10
00:01:04,583 --> 00:01:07,791
The Black Dragon Covenant has declared
war

11
00:01:07,791 --> 00:01:09,333
on the Four Great Houses.

12
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:13,625
If we don't stop them soon, all of Golantis will fall.

13
00:01:15,083 --> 00:01:17,583
Please, my lord…
I'm begging you.

14
00:01:19,208 --> 00:01:20,500
Help us.

15
00:01:29,333 --> 00:01:31,708
You've got the wrong man.

16
00:01:31,791 --> 00:01:33,791
I'm just a miner.

17
00:01:36,708 --> 00:01:38,000
My master!

18
00:01:39,958 --> 00:01:41,958
I won't give up on you!

19
00:01:59,041 --> 00:02:01,041
Severin.

20
00:02:01,041 --> 00:02:02,916
Spend some time with Livia

21
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,666
I'll get dinner ready.

22
00:02:14,291 --> 00:02:15,625
Livia.

23
00:02:15,625 --> 00:02:17,000
Severin,

24
00:02:17,791 --> 00:02:19,333
I'm calling off the engagement.
